00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.050
Terrible story.

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.210
But this is prime example of PTG.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.180
Post-traumatic growth.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.610
Sharing a story, so
others don't feel alone.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.339
Positivity, humor, I'm
a fan, I'm watching.

00:08:40.339 --> 00:08:44.740
This TikTok grandma over here
has some medical questions

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:46.450
and has some medical statements.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:47.283
Are they real?

00:08:47.283 --> 00:08:48.334
Are they not?

00:08:48.334 --> 00:08:49.208
We're going to discuss it here.

00:08:49.208 --> 00:08:50.041
Click here to check that out.

00:08:50.041 --> 00:08:51.370
And while you do that,
stay happy and healthy.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.640
Click it.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:53.520
Grandma.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.353
TikTok grandma.

00:08:54.353 --> 00:08:55.380
GB.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.213
GB.

